name: Foundry Signal
tempo: 108
# 16 bars: two-bar entrance, eight-bar theme, four-bar response, two-bar ending.
# Lead: a repeating A-minor motif with an answering phrase, not randomized pitches.
triangle .30 .006 .11 decay=.16 sustain=.24 cutoff=2400 | r@8 o4 e8 a8 o5 c4 o4 b8 a8 g4 e4 g8 a8 e2 f8 a8 o5 c4 d8 c8 o4 a4 g4 e4 c2 o5 e8 d8 c4 o4 b8 a8 g4 a4 e4 c4 e4 f8 a8 o5 c4 o4 a4 g4 e4 g4 a2 o5 c4 e8 d8 c4 o4 a4 o5 d4 c4 o4 g2 a8 b8 o5 c4 d4 c4 o4 b4 g4 a2 r4 e4 a2 r@4
# Bass: short, filtered attacks; the same pulse follows the chord progression.
sawtooth .36 .005 .08 decay=.12 sustain=.12 cutoff=650 | r@8 o2 /: a@1.5 a@.5 e@2 :/2 /: f@1.5 f@.5 c@2 :/2 /: o3 c@1.5 c@.5 o2 g@2 :/2 /: g@1.5 g@.5 d@2 :/2 a@1.5 a@.5 e@2 f@1.5 f@.5 c@2 o3 c@1.5 c@.5 o2 g@2 g@1.5 g@.5 d@2 a@4 e@2 a@2
# Warm chord bed: Am / F / C / G, with a resolved Am ending.
triangle .13 .12 .4 decay=.4 sustain=.5 cutoff=1200 | o3 [ace]@8 [ace]@8 [fac]@8 [ceg]@8 [gbd]@8 [ace]@4 [fac]@4 [ceg]@4 [gbd]@4 [ace]@8
# Half-time opening; full rhythm enters with the theme.
kick .75 .002 .17 | o2 c@4 c@4 /: c@2 c@2 :/12 c@4 c@4
# Backbeat on beats two and four, with space at the ending.
snare .36 .001 .1 | r@9 /: c@2 :/16 /: c@2 :/8 r@7
# A three-hit hat figure leaves a gap for the melody.
hat .13 .001 .035 | r@8 /: c@1 c@1 c@2 :/12 r@8
